OL,3,GNEWSAWe spent #23,000 on fertility
OL,4,Atreatment - now our embryos will be
OL,5,Adestroyed
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the UK, a sperm or egg donor can
OL,8,Fwithdraw consent up until the embryo is
OL,9,Ftransferred into the womb.
